{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"workshop_t2","model_identifier":"workshop_t2","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# workshop_t2\n\nWorkshop (tier 2): a timber-frame shop with workbenches under a long awning, tools on the wall, a swinging sign.\n\n- Footprint: 8 x 7 columns (128 x 112 units, 3.60 x 3.15 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -62..62, y 0..125, z -58..51 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 92, construction_0 54, construction_33 59, construction_66 74, ruined 56 (8 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- shop: 112 x 128 x 52 centred at x 0, z 22\n- awning: 120 x 60 x 40 at z -24 (units stand under it)\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `workshop_t2_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `workshop_t2_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_workshop_t2` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `working` | 2.4 | loop | `sign` swings. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (-32, 0, -13)\n- `slot_work` at (-8, 0, -40)\n- `slot_work_2` at (32, 0, -40)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (-32, 0, -20)\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"shop_found","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-58.0,0.0,-6.0],"to":[58.0,3.0,50.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[120.0,432.0,236.0,435.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[59.0,438.0,115.0,441.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[120.0,432.0,236.0,435.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[59.0,438.0,115.0,441.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[29.0,131.0,145.0,187.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[29.0,131.0,145.0,187.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"94f4051d-d116-5405-bd72-d07a70fa9a4f"},{"name":"shop_w0_n","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-56.0,3.0,-4.0],"to":[56.0,87.0,0.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[18.0,0.0,130.0,84.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[174.0,0.0,178.0,84.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[18.0,0.0,130.0,84.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[174.0,0.0,178.0,84.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,421.0,112.0,425.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,421.0,112.0,425.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"55045adf-d582-5cde-8e01-5a9a33326d27"},{"name":"shop_w0_s","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-56.0,3.0,44.0],"to":[56.0,87.0,48.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[18.0,0.0,130.0,84.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[178.0,0.0,182.0,84.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[18.0,0.0,130.0,84.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[178.0,0.0,182.0,84.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[112.0,421.0,224.0,425.0],"texture":0